      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHIRLEY NOT (7) raced in a handy position throughout last start and finished fourth, beaten 6 metres, in a far better performance at this track over 1790m. May need luck at some stage extracting from the inside of the second row. Meets a similar line up so she can salute this time around. R ELEVEN ART NZ (2) has had two runs this campaign and is yet to finish in the top three. Was again unable to find the frame last time when he finished fourth over 1790m at this track, beaten 11 metres. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Meets a comparable field and he can figure in the finish. MIDNIGHT PIRATE (5) disappointed last time when seventh over 2190m at this track. Can atone. SHES POPPY (6) is in the mix if she can recapture the form from two starts back that saw her finish third over 1790m at this track.",
